WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:03.720
The modern workplace is increasingly
extending beyond the four walls of your

00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:08.340
office. We're working in airplanes, coffee
shops, or in the comfort of our own homes

00:00:08.340 --> 00:00:12.120
But with the flexibility can come
frustration of not having your full

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:16.230
office set up. With just one headset you
can surround yourself with as many

00:00:16.230 --> 00:00:21.119
virtual monitors as you please. Mount
Rogers provides portable infinite screen

00:00:21.119 --> 00:00:25.380
space wherever you go. You have the full
power of the windows that you know and

00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:29.130
love, with reconfigurable private
monitors. Say you get an Excel

00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:32.189
spreadsheet attached in an email that's
way too big for your screen.

00:00:32.189 --> 00:00:36.050
With one click, you can make the screen
bigger and see everything at once.

00:00:36.050 --> 00:00:41.040
Because the headset renders images in
stereo, the user can pull objects from a

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:46.020
2d virtual monitor into a 3d space,
reposition them, and return them to their

00:00:46.020 --> 00:00:50.070
document. Our current research prototypes
allow for hours of use in real-world

00:00:50.070 --> 00:00:53.579
conditions, and we are excited by what
the future holds.

00:00:53.579 --> 00:00:57.870
Headset technology is getting smaller
and lighter and the resolution is only

00:00:57.870 --> 00:01:01.680
getting better. No more worrying about
having enough monitor real estate at

00:01:01.680 --> 00:01:06.720
your desk, or on the go. With Mount Rogers
take the workspace you want

00:01:06.720 --> 00:01:08.930
wherever you want

